            ^"Reputations" STRING "Afflicted +3 (House Bjornaer), Dangerous +2 (Normandy)"
            ^"Combat" STRING "Dodge: Init: +2, Attack n/a, Defense +6/+4, Damage n/a Fist: Init: +2, Attack +4/+6, Defense +6/+4, Damage +2 Bite: Init: +2, Attack +5/+7, Defense +7/+5, Damage +2 Bludgeon: Init: +2, Attack +6/+8, Defense +6/+4, Damage +4 Adjustments for the Berserk Virtue"
